abstract: >-
  Post-disclosure companion repository for the Waypoint T1–T275 blind comparative
  experiment between SubstrateX Aperture™, developed by Arjay Asadi / SubstrateX®,
  and PsiGuard, developed by Bradley Carter / PsiCo, LLC. The repository preserves
  the native PsiGuard disclosure coordinates, frozen Aperture references used for
  comparison, source-turn joins, event-level results, exploratory analysis, claim
  boundaries, and methodological interpretation. Aperture and PsiGuard were
  developed independently and retain separate system, evidentiary, and intellectual-
  property lineages.
